        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIaAtr">VIIa Atr</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ on æghwilcan mynstre singe eal geferræden ætgædere heora saltere þa ðry dagas.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And in every religious foundation, on these three days, all the brotherhood in common shall chant [the psalms from] their psalters.</ab>
